OL,3,GNEWSARoad to remain closed after       
OL,4,Alandslip                               
OL,6,FA road "at risk of further collapse" is
OL,7,Fto remain closed ahead of major repairs
OL,8,Fafter a landslip caused land beneath it
OL,9,Fto give way, highways bosses have said.
OL,11,FDevon County Council shut the B3230    
OL,12,Fnear Muddiford on 20 November after    
OL,13,Fheavy rain damaged the embankment      
OL,14,Fsupporting it.                         
OL,16,FFurther sections of the road edge had  
OL,17,Fcollapsed since, leaving a 4m (13ft)   
OL,18,Fdrop and parts of the exposed bank     
OL,19,F"almost vertical," Devon County Council
OL,20,Fsaid.                                  
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
